        "title": "An important part of Nepal Culture",
        "text": "We came here with a local guide. We had been to Varanasi and had that experience. This was similar. It is still a place to be respectful of the deceased and their family.  We did not stay long, but did experience a small amount of knowledge about the Nepal culture and their way concerning life/death processing. Between India and Nepal, I have had a lot of contemplation concerning this subject. It is most likely to have that effect, which is one of the great things about travel!",
